N5008 [temp.variadic]/4-5.  Forwarding a non-type parameter pack `T...` into
another template-argument list (`cnt<T...>::n`) preserves its arity for 0, 1, 2
and 4 elements.  Previously the pack collapsed to a single element for two or
more elements (a non-type pack was scalar-bound to its first argument in the
template map).  Non-vacuous: under the collapse each `n` would be 1.
